WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:06.142
A pattern is something that repeats again and again. Look at this one.

00:06.592 --> 00:10.075
Blue, orange, blue, orange. It repeats.

00:10.525 --> 00:16.516
What comes next? Look at the pattern. Blue, orange, blue, orange, and then?

00:16.966 --> 00:22.330
Blue comes next. The pattern goes blue, orange, blue, orange, blue.

00:22.780 --> 00:27.726
To find what comes next, say the pattern, and see what repeats.

00:28.176 --> 00:34.748
Now you try. Find a pattern around you, like stripes or tiles. Say it out loud,

00:34.748 --> 00:36.744
and see what comes next.
